# Per-folder expectations (the two ownership rules below are unchanged):
#
#   risks/         contributor-editable risk data (YAML)
#   controls/      contributor-editable control data (YAML)
#   mitigations/   contributor-editable mitigation prose (Markdown + frontmatter)
#                  ^ these three are the external contribution surface; the build
#                    guarantees they cannot inject executable output (field
#                    escaping + allowlist linter + global id-uniqueness +
#                    pinned inline-script manifest + hardened CSP).
#   templates/     document skeleton (head/tail) and flow/ generated-content
#                  placement — reviewed code, changes the whole document.
#   scripts/       build, assemble, lint and verification code — reviewed code.
#   vendor/        pinned third-party assets, checksum-verified — reviewed code.
#   Webflow/       landing-page export (not contributor-facing) — reviewed;
#                  hardened at build by scripts/process-webflow.mjs.
#   assets/        images shipped with the spec — reviewed.
#   docs/          contributor and design notes — reviewed.
#   .github/       CI and workflows — reviewed code.
#   root files     package.json, bs-config.cjs, valos-spec.html (generated),
#                  README, LICENSE — reviewed code.

